# Put real database exports here

Use one folder per source and keep the original export files unchanged.

Required:
- Scopus: CSV and BibTeX, all fields selected.
- Web of Science Core Collection: Plain Text or BibTeX, Full Record and Cited References.
- IEEE Xplore: RIS and BibTeX.
- Optica Publishing Group and SPIE: RIS/BibTeX.
- ScienceDirect, SpringerLink, Wiley: RIS/BibTeX where available.
- Rayyan: CSV exports for title/abstract screening, full-text screening, decisions, labels, exclusion reasons, and data extraction.
- Proof screenshots: query pasted, filters, result count, export date/time.

Never overwrite raw exports. Store cleaned/merged files separately.
